      "y": 0.4144851657940661,
      "rationale_cn": "最大单项路径。条件于90分钟已打平后，主入口为1-1、0-0和2-2，其中1-1与0-0合计权重很高；淘汰赛加时通常先控制被转换打穿的风险。两队上轮均90分钟解决且休息四天，缺少单边体能崩盘证据，因此120分钟仍平、进入点球应保留为最高概率。",
      "rationale_en": "Largest single conditional path. After a 90-minute draw, the main entries are 1-1, 0-0, and 2-2, with 1-1 and 0-0 carrying substantial weight. Extra time in knockout football usually starts by controlling transition risk. Because both teams advanced in 90 minutes last round and have four days of rest, there is no clear one-sided fatigue-collapse signal, so a 120-minute draw and penalties remain the highest-probability route."
    },
    {
      "increment": "0-1",
      "score": "0-1",
      "extra_goals_a": 0,
      "extra_goals_b": 1,
      "conditional_probability": 0.19720767888307167,
      "joint_probability": 0.05432692307692308,
      "extra_time_outcome": "team_b",
      "category": "extra_time_resolution",
      "deviation_score": 0.33999999999999997,
      "x": 0.33999999999999997,
      "y": 0.19720767888307167,
      "rationale_cn": "西班牙加时净胜一球略高于法国1-0。Merino后插上、Fabian或中场二点球、控球压迫和避免点球的运动战动机，使西班牙在90-120分钟有轻微更明确的主动解决路径；但幅度很小，不能视作单边优势。",
      "rationale_en": "Spain winning extra time by one goal is slightly higher than France 1-0. Merino's late midfield runs, Fabian or second balls in midfield, possession pressure, and the incentive to avoid penalties give Spain a slightly clearer open-play route in minutes 90-120; but the margin is very small and not a one-sided edge."
    },
    {
      "increment": "1-0",
      "score": "1-0",
      "extra_goals_a": 1,
      "extra_goals_b": 0,
      "conditional_probability": 0.16492146596858648,
      "joint_probability": 0.045432692307692306,
      "extra_time_outcome": "team_a",
      "category": "extra_time_resolution",
      "deviation_score": 0.33999999999999997,
      "x": 0.33999999999999997,
      "y": 0.16492146596858648,
      "rationale_cn": "法国加时净胜一球接近西班牙方向。核心来自姆巴佩、登贝莱、Olise或高速替补在西班牙前压后的纵深反击窗口；若西班牙105分钟后因点球历史压力提高边后卫和中场线高度，法国单次高价值机会会上升。",
      "rationale_en": "A one-goal France edge in extra time is close to Spain's corresponding path. It mainly comes from the vertical counterattacking window for Mbappe, Dembele, Olise, or fast substitutes behind Spain's high line. If Spain raise their full-backs and midfield line after 105 minutes because of penalty-history pressure, France's single high-value chance can increase."
    },
    {
      "increment": "1-1",
      "score": "1-1",
      "extra_goals_a": 1,
      "extra_goals_b": 1,
      "conditional_probability": 0.09336823734729488,
      "joint_probability": 0.025721153846153817,
      "extra_time_outcome": "draw",
      "category": "penalty_entry",
      "deviation_score": 0.3,
      "x": 0.3,
      "y": 0.09336823734729488,
      "rationale_cn": "中低概率但必须保留。若90分钟入口为2-2或更高比分，说明比赛已出现空间拉大、换人后结构不稳或首球后开放的迹象；加时一方先进球后，落后方会提高风险，形成双方各进一球但仍未分胜负的路径。",
      "rationale_en": "Low-to-mid probability but must be kept. If the 90-minute entry is 2-2 or higher, it suggests the match has already shown wider spaces, instability after substitutions, or openness after the first goal; if one side scores first in extra time, the trailing side will take more risks, creating a path where both teams score once but the match remains level."
    },
