      "y": 0.035776614310645743,
      "rationale_cn": "法国两球分离为尾部。通常需要法国先通过反击或边路单挑破门，随后西班牙为追平极端压上，再被姆巴佩、登贝莱或其他速度点打第二次身后。该路径有机制支持，但需要首球和追赶态势叠加。",
      "rationale_en": "A two-goal France separation is a tail outcome. It usually requires France to score first through a counter or wide 1v1, then Spain to push extremely high for an equalizer and get hit in behind again by Mbappe, Dembele, or another pace outlet. This path has a clear mechanism, but needs the first goal and chasing game state to stack together."
    },
